            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima Nahashi Omuamoni yainamuka, yaateera Yabeshi-gileadi orusiisira kugirwanisa; aba Yabeshi boona baamugira bati: Tukorese endagaano, tugume tukuheereze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.17.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 17:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nahashi Omuamoni yaabagira ati: Ku muraikirize ku mbanonkoramu amaisho ga buryo, niinyija kugibakoresa; kandi nkigire ekijumo ahari Israeli yoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakuru ba Yabeshi baamugarukamu bati: Ba oturekire okumara ebiro mushanju, tubanze tutume entumwa, zirabe omuri Israeli yoona; ku turaabure kijuna, nitwija kukwehongyera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
