            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.19.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 19:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima abantu baagira Samueli bati: Hari n'oha owaagizire ati: Ebyo Saulo aryatutegyeka? Mureete abo bashaija, tubaite. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.19.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 19:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.14.45"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 14:45",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka Saulo yaagira ati: Hatagira omuntu n'omwe owaitwa eri izooba; ahakuba eri izooba MUKAMA yaakora eby'okujuna Abaisraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samueli yaagira abantu ati: Mwije tuze Gilugaali, tuhamizeyo obugabe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu boona baaza Gilugaali; okwo niyo baayemekyeire Saulo omu maisho ga MUKAMA, bakatambirayo empongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye omu maisho ge; kandi niyo Saulo n'Abaisraeli boona baayesiimiire munonga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
